{"id":"impacto","lemma":"impacto","pos":"noun","rank":2218,"glosses":["impact, brunt","hit (e.g., bullets, artillery)"],"ipa":"/imˈpaɡto/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"impactos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/0e/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-impacto.wav","examples":[{"text":"Preparaos para el impacto.","en":"Brace yourselves for impact.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/806793","words":[{"g":"to prepare","l":"preparar"},{"g":"for"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Adopten la posición de impacto.","en":"Brace yourselves for impact.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/703304","words":[{"g":"to adopt","l":"adoptar"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"position"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"El impacto de la ciencia en la sociedad es grande.","en":"The impact of science on society is great.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,null,null,{"g":"science"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"society, social order"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"big, large"}],"phrases":[[2,4,"of the"]]},{"text":"El parachoques absorbió parte del impacto.","en":"The car bumper absorbed some of the impact.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"bumper"},{"g":"to absorb","l":"absorber"},{"g":"part"},{"g":"of the"},null]},{"text":"Su muerte le causó un gran impacto a su mujer.","en":"His death was great shock to his wife.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/693060","words":[{"g":"his / her / your"},{"g":"death"},{"g":"him / her"},{"g":"to cause, to make","l":"causar"},{"g":"a"},null,null,{"g":"to"},{"g":"his / her / your"},{"g":"woman"}]}]}